Sorry, I misunderstood your question. For FreeDOS, I think you will need to=
 write a new OSL (OS Services Layer) that is specific for FreeDOS. The exis=
ting Windows OSL in the ACPICA source could be used as a starting point.
=C2=A0
You could modify/use the Unix makefiles to build the software. However, we =
also provide project files for MS visual C if those would be useful.
=C2=A0
Bob
